  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4602.05 Name of Carrier",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4602.05 Name of Carrier.\n\n(a) Any vehicle registered with the bureau as a household goods carrier shall display in a conspicuous place on both sides of each vehicle the name of the carrier that appears on the certificate or permit.\n\n(b) The identifying letters on the vehicle shall be large enough to be legible at a distance of 50 feet.\n\nSource. #5852, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7240, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9379, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12358, eff 8-2-17; ss by #13828, eff 12-22-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4600)",
